WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:03,320
Zhangguan, what is the specific knowledge you are talking about?

2
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:06,300
The opening of Yushan Mountain and the Yushui Bridge

3
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:08,740
Mobilize the most advanced underwater biomass detection when necessary

4
00:00:08,740 --> 00:00:09,740
Deep and shallow equipment

5
00:00:10,740 --> 00:00:12,660
Leader, if I promise

6
00:00:12,660 --> 00:00:14,620
Can you help me change my travel flag to a fixed date?

7
00:00:14,620 --> 00:00:15,580
what are you thinking

8
00:00:15,580 --> 00:00:18,700
At most, it will count as meritorious service and a reduced sentence, if you do it or not.

9
00:00:18,700 --> 00:00:20,340
I went to find Xiang Bantou from the Northern School.

10
00:00:20,340 --> 00:00:21,700
He is also serving jail time now

11
00:00:21,700 --> 00:00:23,100
Xiang Lao Er

12
00:00:23,100 --> 00:00:24,940
Those country rats from the north

13
00:00:24,940 --> 00:00:26,540
Besides being able to drill holes, what else can I order?

14
00:00:26,540 --> 00:00:29,820
There is nothing better than listening to thunder spread in my family.

15
00:00:30,140 --> 00:00:31,940
Is it your turn to slam the table in front of me?

16
00:00:33,220 --> 00:00:34,140
Commander, I'm sorry

17
00:00:34,140 --> 00:00:36,810
Excited Excited

18
00:00:36,810 --> 00:00:38,050
Will you answer it now?

19
00:00:38,050 --> 00:00:39,250
I'll be the first to say the ugly things

20
00:00:39,250 --> 00:00:41,810
If you dare to have any evil thoughts underwater

21
00:00:41,810 --> 00:00:43,810
The four illegitimate children you are hiding overseas

22
00:00:43,810 --> 00:00:44,810
Six pieces

23
00:00:44,810 --> 00:00:46,370
Including a few hiding abroad

24
00:00:46,370 --> 00:00:48,810
They will all be jointly extradited to the country within one day.

25
00:00:48,810 --> 00:00:49,970
You can do it yourself

26
00:00:49,970 --> 00:00:51,450
These are all my identities as a dead person

27
00:00:51,450 --> 00:00:53,090
I made a top-secret fake account.

28
00:00:53,090 --> 00:00:54,770
Even the people closest to me don’t know

29
00:00:54,770 --> 00:00:56,650
How could they find out clearly?

30
00:00:56,650 --> 00:00:58,410
If you go, press your fingerprints

31
00:00:58,410 --> 00:01:02,300
Dare to ask the commander

32
00:01:02,300 --> 00:01:04,300
Which department are you in?
